WEBVTT

00:22:29.163 --> 00:22:31.746
the current concerns about movie theaters
and public health existed.

00:22:32.329 --> 00:22:35.163
But I imagine you must be thinking about
that a lot during this time right now.

00:22:35.371 --> 00:22:39.204
So do you have any new perspective
on why movies matter

00:22:39.204 --> 00:22:40.538
and why this experience matters?

00:22:41.121 --> 00:22:45.871
Well, you know, I think the absence of
these communal environments wherein we

00:22:45.871 --> 00:22:47.954
learn about what it means
to be human and right.

00:22:47.954 --> 00:22:51.079
And that was sort of a link that I was
making between religion and movies,

00:22:51.079 --> 00:22:55.246
is that, you know, um, but I think what's
interesting to me about movies and

00:22:55.246 --> 00:22:58.121
I would include television and really
any storytelling in this regard

00:22:58.204 --> 00:23:02.663
or art more generally, the movies as
a popular medium is that, you know,